<title>SRI LANKA: Port conditions update - Sri Lanka - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Sri Lanka - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>COLOMBO, Jan 15 - Eleven container dischargers/loaders, five food dischargers, seven general cargo disargers, one cement discharger and one fertiliser discharger presently working in port. Five container dischargers/loaders awaiting berths. --</p>
</text>
